 "Below examples are taken from Prof. Gabriel T. Landi\[CloseCurlyQuote]s ",
 ButtonBox["melt notebook",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://melt1.notion.site/Melt-2d05fca5cfa342e28cafaf6fe26e049e"], 
