     RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Pi]", "/", "2"}]}], "]"}], 
     RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", "\"\<J-\>\"", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
